Comment: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,=======TEXT=======
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.40,0:00:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}其實 我有個小禮物要送給你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.24,0:00:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}欸 什麼什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.49,0:00:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}當心腳下哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.29,0:00:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.47,0:00:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.41,0:01:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我記得是在這…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.62,0:01:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}歡迎來到我自己的秘密基地
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.35,0:01:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}遙乃的秘密基地…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.63,0:01:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.68,0:01:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在燈塔底下？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.17,0:01:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}正所謂燈下黑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.21,0:01:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}開個玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.95,0:03:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}燈塔的底下竟然有地下室…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.31,0:03:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就像拍電影一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.66,0:03:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}聽說這裡是偷偷改建的空間哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.86,0:03:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不好意思哈 還要讓你們來幫忙打掃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.54,0:03:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.67,0:03:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}秘密基地 秘密基地！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.17,0:03:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那個 寶 寶木同學你 為什麼有 地下室的鑰匙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.44,0:03:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不愧是海果 讓你發現了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.36,0:03:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不愧是海果 真機靈
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.57,0:03:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.47,0:03:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}其實 我的爺爺以前是這座燈塔的管理員
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.75,0:03:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}自從這座燈塔廢棄以後
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.20,0:03:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}爺爺他就把這個地下室拿來
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.61,0:04:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}當我們在一起玩的秘密基地
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.66,0:04:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}後來 鑰匙丟了 最近也就沒怎麼來過了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.66,0:04:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那麼 從今天開始 我們就來這一起玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.11,0:04:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯 暢快玩吧 幽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.88,0:04:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}給 鑰匙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.78,0:04:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}給我？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.24,0:04:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}因為聽到幽在燈塔住著以後
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.82,0:04:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就很一直很擔心你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.71,0:04:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所以這個房間就交給你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.16,0:04:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}遙 遙 遙 遙乃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.26,0:04:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.36,0:04:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這樣 這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.48,0:04:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}以後就把這裡當做我們一起的秘密基地吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.29,0:04:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}三個人的…秘密基地
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.01,0:04:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}本來就是遙乃你的基地
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.33,0:04:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我怎麼能獨吞呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.31,0:04:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}欸？但 但是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.97,0:04:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你在這地方有很多回憶吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.99,0:04:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}遙乃能經常來一起玩的話
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.85,0:04:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我覺得也不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.67,0:04:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}確實呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.55,0:04:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.47,0:05:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}打倒瞬大作戰
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.89,0:05:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}第一次作戰會議
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.45,0:05:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}明天就是星期六了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.10,0:05:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}先抓緊去買東西吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.50,0:05:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}買東西？要出去玩了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.75,0:05:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯 最近材料有點缺了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.65,0:05:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯 嗯… 絕 絕緣膠帶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.00,0:05:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快沒有了 要補充一點
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.25,0:05:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}再 再要一些硬塑膠板當機翼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.77,0:05:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}還有呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.72,0:05:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}珍珠
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.72,0:05:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我想嚐嚐珍珠奶茶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.73,0:05:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}「珍珠奶茶」…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.42,0:05:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啊啦 珍珠
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.45,0:05:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那麼 明天早上十點碰面吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.81,0:05:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要出去玩咯 好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.69,0:05:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}姐姐的頭髮太硬了 必須要再收拾一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.50,0:05:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}穗 穗波 謝謝你幫我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.05,0:05:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}姐姐確實很少讓人幫忙呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.25,0:05:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要去哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.85,0:06:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}去 去街上買東西
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.89,0:06:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.23,0:06:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}Bonavuu！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.19,0:06:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}M-Mativuu 寶木
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.11,0:06:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}還有十五分鐘呢 你來得真早
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.83,0:06:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我 我也是才到的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.57,0:06:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}Bonavuu！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.10,0:06:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}抱歉 我沒遲到吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.92,0:06:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}Mativuu
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.98,0:06:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒有沒有 剛好到點
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.21,0:06:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}M-Mativuu
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.03,0:06:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我 我也才到這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.86,0:06:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}先去把小材料都買來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.28,0:07:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哇 全是塑膠瓶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.49,0:07:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這些可以免費拿走嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.09,0:07:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對 我已經向店長溝通過了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.93,0:07:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這下不用再讓明內同學硬喝了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.41,0:07:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可 可是 這些
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.81,0:07:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}似乎沒幾個大小合適的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.39,0:07:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太小了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.41,0:07:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你們 也要這個吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.94,0:08:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.04,0:08:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.94,0:08:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要幾個
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.05,0:08:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}要…六個吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.91,0:08:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}給
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.45,0:08:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.44,0:08:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}給
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.09,0:08:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}謝謝 謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.85,0:08:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.24,0:08:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}能碰到這麼善良的人真好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.07,0:08:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這下就把所有東西都買齊了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.06,0:08:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}任務完成！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.78,0:08:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}然後呢 然後呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.91,0:08:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對啊 正好還有點時間
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.73,0:08:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}開玩！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.81,0:09:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這個就是大頭貼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.50,0:09:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}閃閃發光的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.14,0:09:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我還是第一次拍呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.45,0:09:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我 我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.96,0:09:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}話說
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.95,0:09:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果都沒有好好出鏡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.74,0:09:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我 我不怎麼拍照
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.54,0:09:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那麼 下次讓海果站中間吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.13,0:09:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我 我就算 算 算了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.60,0:09:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不可以哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.40,0:09:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}被抓的外星人？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.21,0:09:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}還不是因為海果要跑嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.19,0:09:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}拍得有點奇怪呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.49,0:09:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}再來一次吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.91,0:09:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不用
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.23,0:09:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這樣挺好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.03,0:10:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這樣就很好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.84,0:10:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}再拍一張
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.67,0:10:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}再拍一張嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.91,0:10:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}求求了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.41,0:10:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我也想用春日限定風格pose拍照！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.27,0:10:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}幽看起來很想再拍一張
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.67,0:10:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}珍珠奶茶 好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.76,0:10:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}珍珠珍珠 奶茶奶茶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.85,0:10:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}珍珠奶茶~
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.32,0:10:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}珍珠珍珠 奶茶奶茶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.19,0:10:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啦啦啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.43,0:10:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}還是頭一次這樣和別人一起出去玩
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.54,0:10:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對了 要不去文具店裡看看吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.40,0:10:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯 當然可以
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.03,0:10:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.30,0:10:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.17,0:10:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}下一次想要和雷門同學一起來呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.22,0:10:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯？鋼魃里歐？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.33,0:10:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是機器人的動畫呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.37,0:10:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}小學的時候 在學校很流行呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.29,0:10:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}中 中學的時候 聽說雷門同學…好像很喜歡這個
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.75,0:11:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}別偷聽啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.83,0:11:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啊 是這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.34,0:11:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}欸 很帥啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.53,0:11:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那 那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.77,0:11:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.74,0:11:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}火 火箭的設計…就用這個…怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.98,0:11:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.03,0:11:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我為什麼要認真去做這種塑膠火箭東西
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.08,0:11:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蠢死了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.62,0:11:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒有興趣的事情 就沒必要去做
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.78,0:11:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對於她們來說也是一樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.46,0:11:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只不過 製作火箭就是需要我的技術
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.18,0:11:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}對了 互相都沒有興趣的話
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.83,0:11:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這事就結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.38,0:11:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這樣不就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.13,0:11:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這樣的比賽趕緊結束掉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.49,0:12:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}終於 激動人心的決勝時刻來了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.20,0:12:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}塑膠瓶火箭比賽開幕了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.23,0:12:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}流星隊的海果隊員
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.12,0:12:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你現在的感想是？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.60,0:12:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}流星隊？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.44,0:12:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}剛剛想的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.85,0:12:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}請說說你的感想
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.94,0:12:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}必 必 必 必勝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.21,0:12:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}敵對的瞬
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.74,0:12:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你的感想呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.93,0:12:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我可以回去了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.36,0:12:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}還有 今天早上吃的什麼呀？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.18,0:12:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}喂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.89,0:12:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}喜歡往增味湯裡加什麼呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.51,0:12:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}聽人話啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.15,0:12:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}喜歡吃麵包還是米飯？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.85,0:12:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}喜歡吃米飯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.14,0:12:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}別把我扯進你們的鬧劇啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.94,0:12:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}快點開始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.87,0:12:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}欸！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.83,0:12:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}比賽前就是要這種熱鬧的感覺啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.30,0:12:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那你十天前的早餐是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.82,0:12:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.57,0:12:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}十 十天前？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.90,0:12:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}呃…嗯…
Dialogue: 1,0:12:47.25,0:12:48.83,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}1…2…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.57,0:12:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}笨蛋電波
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.21,0:12:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}先說一下規則吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.71,0:12:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}想不起來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.49,0:12:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}兩枚火箭決勝可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.33,0:12:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.59,0:13:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}雙方各自發射兩枚火箭
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.43,0:13:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}然後記錄較好的一枚
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.06,0:13:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}會被採用然後決勝嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.85,0:13:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.28,0:13:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}塑膠瓶火箭飛得更遠的就可以贏
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.05,0:13:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這沒問題吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.98,0:13:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}呃…嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.18,0:13:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}先攻
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.24,0:13:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}喲
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.01,0:13:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.87,0:13:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那我立起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.40,0:13:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.73,0:13:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}他們的火箭…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.68,0:13:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}塗裝和配色和鋼魃里歐馬克3號的胸部裝甲有點…像
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.59,0:13:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不 肯定是偶然 偶然！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.98,0:13:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}3 2 1
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.91,0:14:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}103公尺
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.74,0:14:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好欸 超過100公尺了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.64,0:14:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}最高 記錄
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.94,0:14:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這樣的話應該能贏雷門同學了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.83,0:14:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.40,0:14:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒問題的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.30,0:14:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我們的 我們一起做的火箭一定可以
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.37,0:14:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}肯定沒問題的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.03,0:14:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}請飛得再遠一些吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.12,0:14:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}為了將這份想法傳達給雷門同學
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.82,0:15:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}第2枚超過了110公尺
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.31,0:15:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}風向也是逆風的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.77,0:15:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}精確設計的機身…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.93,0:15:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}水壓和氣壓
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.28,0:15:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}他們確實做得很極致了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.54,0:15:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在測試裡我得出的最好成績是107公尺
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.06,0:15:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}剛才的成績也已經是非常好的了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.08,0:15:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}如果只靠手壓泵
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.79,0:15:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}想贏的話恐怕會很困難
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.86,0:15:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}他們的馬克Ⅲ 做得不錯嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.55,0:15:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}乖~乖
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.99,0:15:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.67,0:15:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}別以為這樣就贏了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.44,0:15:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我可是還有一枚火箭
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.12,0:15:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你們的成績 我輕輕鬆鬆就可以超越
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.63,0:15:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就用它！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.84,0:15:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.59,0:15:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}欸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.79,0:15:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好像和我知道的塑膠瓶火箭不太一樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.97,0:15:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.85,0:15:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}塑膠瓶火箭？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.87,0:16:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}說什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.02,0:16:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你們做的不就是水壓火箭嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.21,0:16:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}也沒有不能把動力源換成火藥這種規則吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.07,0:16:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}給我飛到更高的地方吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.16,0:16:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}超過他們！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.76,0:16:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}飛行高度為127公尺
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.73,0:16:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}是我贏了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.35,0:16:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好厲害…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.16,0:16:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不對 你耍賴
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.73,0:16:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}這是耍賴 犯規的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.24,0:16:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哪裡耍賴了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.10,0:16:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我外殼用的是塑膠瓶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.80,0:16:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就算用的動力是火藥的模型火箭也沒違反規則
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.05,0:16:51.67,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你們3對1 那才是犯規吧
Dialogue: 1,0:16:51.68,0:16:53.66,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}而且都還沒有測距離
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.72,0:16:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}輸了 輸掉了
Dialogue: 1,0:16:53.79,0:16:55.54,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}分明就是耍賴
Dialogue: 1,0:16:56.10,0:16:57.94,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}高度也算是距離啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.66,0:16:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}明明這是最後一次和雷門同學說話的機會
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.77,0:17:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}搞什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.93,0:17:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}只是輸了這種比賽就一副世界完了的表情
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.64,0:17:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}搞得我好像才是壞人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.12,0:17:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}喂 好歹我給你看了這些好東西
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.22,0:17:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}別給我低沉著臉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.29,0:17:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是氣不打一處來
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.79,0:17:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}說吧 你想說的話
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.93,0:17:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}敗犬的嚎叫 我還是會聽聽的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.15,0:17:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可 可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.73,0:17:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啊 可以
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.01,0:17:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}隨便你說就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.94,0:17:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.38,0:17:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}反正也是「幫我做火箭 給我需要的部件」
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.57,0:17:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}之類的自以為是的話唄
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.82,0:17:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}還故意繞這麼遠的路
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.07,0:17:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}結果還是輸了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.78,0:17:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}雷 雷門同學
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.26,0:17:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}最後被可憐 才能有機會
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.19,0:17:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那 那個
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.51,0:17:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就讓我把這種願望
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.97,0:17:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}徹底斷絕了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.52,0:18:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你 你頭上的 那個護目鏡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.96,0:18:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好酷！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.32,0:18:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蛤？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.44,0:18:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}從初 國中的時候我就這麼覺得了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.57,0:18:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}一直
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.66,0:18:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}很想這麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.03,0:18:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}雷門同學的護目鏡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.75,0:18:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好好好 好酷
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.03,0:18:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蛤？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.70,0:18:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我 我也想戴了看看
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.30,0:18:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}蛤？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.25,0:18:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}難道你想直接對我說的就是這個？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.03,0:18:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯…嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.29,0:18:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.80,0:18:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}因為雷門同學從那以後就沒來學校了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.46,0:18:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就沒 沒有可以說的機會
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.83,0:18:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所以 所以就
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.58,0:18:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}那個 我如果
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.41,0:18:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}還 還能在 學 學校見到雷門同學的話
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.03,0:18:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.28,0:19:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}今 今天的比賽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.94,0:19:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}雖 雖然很不甘心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.23,0:19:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}但我很開心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.15,0:19:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}有機會 再一起玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.89,0:19:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我 我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.67,0:19:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}去買飲料…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.55,0:19:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啊啦 海果？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.91,0:19:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}還真是海果的風格
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.07,0:19:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯…但總感覺好像忘了最初的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.95,0:19:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不過 好像也不重要了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.94,0:19:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}瞬 我們也玩的很高興哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.49,0:19:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所以下次再一起哦 瞬
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.05,0:19:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}下次就在學校吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.11,0:19:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}海果  我也要
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.40,0:19:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}哦呃 還有遙乃的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.45,0:19:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}你們兩個 自動販賣機在另外一邊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.63,0:19:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}搞什麼呀 這些傢伙到底搞什麼鬼呀
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.15,0:19:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}啊啊 真是無聊的傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.39,0:20:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真的 好無聊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.92,0:20:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}檢查鞋櫃嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.97,0:20:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不知道瞬來了沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.43,0:20:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}沒事的 去教室吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.57,0:20:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.52,0:20:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}Bonavuu~
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.05,0:20:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}好吵
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.96,0:20:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}雷 雷門同學
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.67,0:20:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可別搞錯了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.51,0:20:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}我只是因為出勤時間不太夠 所以才來的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.47,0:20:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}鞋子都沒換呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.32,0:20:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}不換鞋是不行的
Dialogue: 1,0:20:54.75,0:20:56.74,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}已經抹布擦乾淨了 所以沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.31,0:20:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}室內鞋我忘記帶了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.95,0:21:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.16,0:21:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}別一直盯著我看了行嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.66,0:21:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}光憑你們想要造去宇宙的火箭
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.03,0:21:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}估計一輩子都不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.22,0:21:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}拉胯得讓我很不爽
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.87,0:21:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}所以 稍微一點的話 我也不是不能幫你們
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.71,0:21:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}在賺出勤時間的順便
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.82,0:21:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.10,0:21:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.32,0:23:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}幽 幽
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.27,0:23:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}可以和我也來一下額門感應嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.30,0:23:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\blur2}OK
